<title>UK: BayerVB sets C$100 million December 2002 bond.</title>
<headline>BayerVB sets C$100 million December 2002 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers BayerVB and CIBC Wood Gundy.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE VEREINSBANK</p>
<p> AMT    C$100 MLN     COUPON     6.00	MATURITY    27.DEC.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.325   PAY DATE  S-11.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.725    SPREAD	+25 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> IBCA	 AA+	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMS US/UK/CA/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMANY   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.275     SELL CONC  1.60	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 7.0 PCT 2001 CANADAS -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
